{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Hello, agent. Well, former agent now...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were an elite driver for the Major Crimes Agency. In the wake of an operation gone wrong you were fired and the truth was hastily forgotten. You found the underworld, selling your unique skills to anyone willing to pay for them. And that's when the mysterious 'Merlin' appeared, offering you a chance at revenge</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drive fast</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get behind the wheel of car chases straight out of a\u00a0neon noir  action movie. The world is monochrome but you and your objectives burn bright with colour</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play your way</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel a conspiracy in story mode or get straight to the driving. Instaplay features Infinite Run, Pursuit, Escape and more </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rock out</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a completely original, pulse pounding score from a range of awesome composers </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built for accessibility</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No game is perfect but Highway Noir is for as many people as possible with optional subtitles, tone tags, game speed adjustment, vision assist and more to come </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Come out on top </strong><br>Work as a freelancer, choosing the best jobs at the best prices. Take on the Major Crimes Agency with Merlin's help. If you think you can put your trust in an enigma...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317730/extras/4a6d3bea370b704aedded820a5822d00.avif?t=1757341129\" width=162 height=162 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This developer assures that no gen AI was used in this indie game. The use of any part of Midnight Asphalt or related materials for training generative AI is NOT permitted</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3317730?t=1757341129","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3317730?t=1757341129","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317730/c74246f2e8a9d61668ece082fc579d4144142be9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757341129","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317730/c74246f2e8a9d61668ece082fc579d4144142be9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757341129","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Hello, agent. Well, former agent now...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were an elite driver for the Major Crimes Agency. In the wake of an operation gone wrong you were fired and the truth was hastily forgotten. You found the underworld, selling your unique skills to anyone willing to pay for them. And that's when the mysterious 'Merlin' appeared, offering you a chance at revenge</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drive fast</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >